-# Astra 1.5.0 — The Goldfish Lab
+# Astra 1.5.1 — The Goldfish Lab
+
+## Exotic Orchard convenience (1.5.1)
+
+**Exotic Orchard: all colors** is a game setting and defaults to **on**. While enabled, Exotic Orchard behaves as though an opponent controls a land that can produce W, U, B, R, or G, so it always offers all five colored mana choices in goldfish play. Disable it under **Menu → Settings** to return to modeled opponent-land behavior.
+
+Older saved sessions that do not contain this setting also use the on-by-default behavior until explicitly disabled. The setting is stored in the game session once changed and is undoable/replayable like the other engine settings.
 
